{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1549709-gift-of-kuruth","id":1549709,"title":"Gift of Kuruth","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-04-01T07:50:36-07:00","id":1549709,"title":"Gift of Kuruth","content":"<br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Gift of Kuruth</span></b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fetch! (Cunning)</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Them pups can get real fixated on stuff, an' with this here gift, ya can work that to your favor, ya hear?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Action: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Reflexive </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Duration: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">UntilKuruth ends or the target is destroyed</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The werewolf picks out a target, and bless their heart, till that thing's put down, it ain't gonna bother with nothin' or nobody else during kuruth.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Brown Pants (Glory)</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Lookin' at a howlin' werewolf'll make yer hair stand on end, but bein' on kuruth is downright pants-soilin' scary, I tell ya!</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Action:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Reflexive</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Duration: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Kuruth</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The Gauru's Primal Fear got a big ol' boost, y'all! Now every opponent's gotta roll their Resolve + Composure each turn, and if they flop, they ain't puttin' up no defense that round</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Packbang (Honor)</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">It\u2019s like watchin' them racy flicks, but instead of gettin' busy, it\u2019s all about the raw brawlin\u2019.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Action:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Reflexive</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">If any of yer pack kin spots that character get all worked up in a rage fit, they gotta roll a kuruth check too, but with a penalty that matches that character's Honor.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Red Shirt (Purity)</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">Well, what do ya reckon? That red shirt's a real lifesaver for hidin' them bloodstains, I tell ya!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Duration: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Kuruth</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Once that critter steps into the Basu-Im kuruth stage, they\u2019re fixin' to deal some serious hurt with them teeth and claws! Aggravated hurtin' darlin', nuff said.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Heel Dog! (Wisdom)</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Sometimes ya gotta lay down the law with yer pup, be tougher than a two-dollar steak, can\u2019t let \u2018em run wild makin\u2019 a ruckus all the time.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Cost:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> 1 Essence per target</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Action:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Reflexive</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Duration: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Kuruth</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Y\u2019all pick out a handful of targets, right equal to yer Wisdom, and pay the essence price, then yer character, bless their heart, will always take aim at them last. If there\u2019s anything or anyone else in sight, that character\u2019s fixin\u2019 to take \u2018em down before even thinkin\u2019 \u2018bout messin\u2019 with them marked folks.</span></span><br /> <br /> Happy April Fool's day, had to use a Southern Accent translator for all this, there is a bunch of them inhttps://anythingtranslate.com/ for all kind of stuff<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24813-aeveth","name":"Aeveth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24813_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}